ue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115094","id":3768673712,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7goWWw","user":{"login":"Flynsarmy","id":334808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDgwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy","html_url":"https://github.com/Flynsarmy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T14:42:56Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T14:42:56Z","body":"Ahh, is that documented anywhere? I found `INSTANCE_CUSTOM` here https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.html#vertex-built-ins but it only shows x,y,z values. \r\n\r\nIt looks like changing my vertex() function to the following does indeed fix the issue:\r\n```glsl\r\nvoid vertex() {\r\n    lifecycle_fraction = INSTANCE_CUSTOM.y / INSTANCE_CUSTOM.w;\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3768673712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]